  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPONSORSHIP FOR THE 2025 AFRICA FOOD SYSTEMS FORUM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Africa Food Systems Forum in Senegal, implemented by the Alliance for a Green Revolution in Africa aims to support efforts to give a platform to the young African innovators that are driving the food systems transformation on the continen.  The objectives of the grant are to support the succesful undertaking of the 2025 Africa Food Systems Forum which takes place in Dakar, Senegal in September 2025.  The grant is core support to the AFSF.</narrative>
  </description>
